{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-58617","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-113202","text":"The dedicated-host profile for performance batteries on this machine"}]},{"id":"blk-58618","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113203","marks":["bold"],"text":"Status:"},{"id":"spn-113204","text":" standing operational procedure, adopted 2026-09-12 by ruling 4 of "},{"id":"spn-113205","marks":["code"],"text":"receipts/R7.2.1D-CLOSED.md"},{"id":"spn-113206","text":". It is a "},{"id":"spn-113207","marks":["bold"],"text":"precondition and a preparation"},{"id":"spn-113208","text":", not a gate and not evidence. It rules nothing about any result. "},{"id":"spn-113209","marks":["bold"],"text":"Applies to:"},{"id":"spn-113210","text":" every official performance battery in the ComputeDriven lane from R7.2.1B onward. Battery records cite this file instead of restating it."}]},{"id":"blk-58619","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-113211","text":"0. Why this document exists"}]},{"id":"blk-58620","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113212","text":"Three consecutive attempts at the R7.2.1D-2C battery on this host were refused by their own instruments before a single outcome run was made:"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-58622","spans":[{"id":"spn-113213","text":"attempt"}]},{"id":"blk-58623","spans":[{"id":"spn-113214","text":"host as started"}]},{"id":"blk-58624","spans":[{"id":"spn-113215","text":"baseline level vs fixed reference"}]},{"id":"blk-58625","spans":[{"id":"spn-113216","text":"baseline RSD"}]},{"id":"blk-58626","spans":[{"id":"spn-113217","text":"status"}]}],"id":"blk-58621","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-58627","spans":[{"id":"spn-113218","text":"1"}]},{"id":"blk-58628","spans":[{"id":"spn-113219","text":"load 3.9–4.1, all-core idle 0.81–0.84 (passed an observational wait)"}]},{"id":"blk-58629","spans":[{"id":"spn-113220","marks":["bold"],"text":"−34 %"}]},{"id":"blk-58630","spans":[{"id":"spn-113221","text":"5.7 % / 6.3 %"}]},{"id":"blk-58631","spans":[{"id":"spn-113222","text":"NOT EXECUTED"}]}],[{"id":"blk-58632","spans":[{"id":"spn-113223","text":"2"}]},{"id":"blk-58633","spans":[{"id":"spn-113224","text":"load 6.3, all-core idle 0.76; WebKit, two BEAM nodes, a QEMU guest, a browser"}]},{"id":"blk-58634","spans":[{"id":"spn-113225","marks":["bold"],"text":"−11.8 % / −17.2 %"}]},{"id":"blk-58635","spans":[{"id":"spn-113226","text":"19.2 % / 23.2 %"}]},{"id":"blk-58636","spans":[{"id":"spn-113227","text":"NOT EXECUTED"}]}],[{"id":"blk-58637","spans":[{"id":"spn-113228","text":"3"}]},{"id":"blk-58638","spans":[{"id":"spn-113229","text":"rebooted, one terminal, nothing else running"}]},{"id":"blk-58639","spans":[{"id":"spn-113230","marks":["bold"],"text":"+0.35 % / +1.23 %"}]},{"id":"blk-58640","spans":[{"id":"spn-113231","text":"0.24 % / 0.37 %"}]},{"id":"blk-58641","spans":[{"id":"spn-113232","marks":["bold"],"text":"EXECUTED"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-58642","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113233","text":"The lesson is in the first row, not the third. "},{"id":"spn-113234","marks":["bold"],"text":"An acceptable load average with 81–84 % all-core idle coexisted with a third of the compiled home's capacity gone."},{"id":"spn-113235","text":" Load, idle and PSI are delayed, include work that may not contend, and are blind to contention outside the pinned cores — the four-core witness missed a 13–33 % capacity swing in 2B, and the observational wait passed while capacity was depressed by 34 % in 2C attempt 1. What saw all of it was the sentinel."}]},{"id":"blk-58643","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-113236","text":"1. The procedure"}]},{"id":"blk-58644","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113237","text":"Before an official battery:"}]},{"id":"blk-58645","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-58647","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113238","marks":["bold"],"text":"Reboot the machine."}]}],"id":"blk-58646","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-58649","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113239","marks":["bold"],"text":"Open one terminal only."},{"id":"spn-113240","text":" No second Claude or Codex session, no browser, no"}]}],"id":"blk-58648","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-58650","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113241","text":"VM, no BEAM service, no substantial development workload — including the things that are easy to forget because they are not \"running a program\": an open preview tab holding a render loop, a paused guest, a language server."}]},{"id":"blk-58651","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-58653","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113242","text":"Start the battery from that terminal, with the scratch and target directories"}]}],"id":"blk-58652","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":3},{"id":"blk-58654","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113243","text":"off "},{"id":"spn-113244","marks":["code"],"text":"/tmp"},{"id":"spn-113245","text":" and no development knob set."}]},{"id":"blk-58655","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113246","text":"That is the whole procedure. It takes the host from "},{"id":"spn-113247","marks":["italic"],"text":"shared"},{"id":"spn-113248","text":" to "},{"id":"spn-113249","marks":["italic"],"text":"dedicated"},{"id":"spn-113250","text":"; it does not certify that the host is fast enough, and it never substitutes for a measurement."}]},{"id":"blk-58656","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-113251","text":"2. The gates that actually decide"}]},{"id":"blk-58657","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113252","text":"These are unchanged by this document and remain authoritative:"}]},{"id":"blk-58658","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-58660","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113253","marks":["bold"],"text":"Baseline level"},{"id":"spn-113254","text":" — each policy's baseline mean within its band of a **fixed"}]}],"id":"blk-58659","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-58661","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113255","text":"absolute reference"},{"id":"spn-113256","marks":["bold"],"text":" derived from prior calibration receipts "},{"id":"spn-113257","text":"on the same binary**, never centred on the run's own baseline. This is the guard that catches a consistently depressed host, which RSD alone cannot: a host held at two-thirds of capacity can be perfectly stable there."}]},{"id":"blk-58662","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-58664","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113258","marks":["bold"],"text":"Baseline RSD"},{"id":"spn-113259","text":" — the spread of the baseline sentinels against its cap."}]}],"id":"blk-58663","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-58665","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113260","text":"Clipping to the cap is not a pass."}]},{"id":"blk-58666","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-58668","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113261","marks":["bold"],"text":"Both-policy sentinel pairs bracketing every block"},{"id":"spn-113262","text":" — either policy outside"}]}],"id":"blk-58667","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-58669","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113263","text":"its tolerance refuses the whole shared block."}]},{"id":"blk-58670","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-58672","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113264","marks":["bold"],"text":"Isolation re-applied per block"},{"id":"spn-113265","text":", with each moved process's own mask recorded"}]}],"id":"blk-58671","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-58673","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113266","text":"and restored, and the restored set verified."}]},{"id":"blk-58674","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-58676","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113267","marks":["bold"],"text":"The core witness and the structural witnesses"},{"id":"spn-113268","text":" stay active for every block."}]}],"id":"blk-58675","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-58677","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113269","text":"Either baseline guard failing means "},{"id":"spn-113270","marks":["bold"],"text":"NOT EXECUTED before any outcome run"},{"id":"spn-113271","text":", and the lane stops rather than searching for a favourable window."}]},{"id":"blk-58678","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-113272","text":"3. What a reboot is not"}]},{"id":"blk-58679","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-58681","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113273","text":"It is "},{"id":"spn-113274","marks":["bold"],"text":"not a gate."},{"id":"spn-113275","text":" No record may report \"rebooted\" as a reason a result is"}]}],"id":"blk-58680","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-58682","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113276","text":"trustworthy."}]},{"id":"blk-58683","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-58685","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113277","text":"It is "},{"id":"spn-113278","marks":["bold"],"text":"not evidence."},{"id":"spn-113279","text":" The four numbers that made attempt 3 believable are the"}]}],"id":"blk-58684","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-58686","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113280","text":"two baseline levels and the two baseline RSDs, followed by 21 in-tolerance sentinel pairs — every one of them a measurement taken after the reboot."}]},{"id":"blk-58687","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-58689","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113281","text":"It is "},{"id":"spn-113282","marks":["bold"],"text":"not sufficient."},{"id":"spn-113283","text":" A dedicated host still drifts: attempt 3's RR-FAIR"}]}],"id":"blk-58688","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-58690","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113284","text":"sentinel fell 1.7 % monotonically over twelve blocks on an idle machine while CLOCK-AGE stayed flat. Within tolerance, no block refused, cause unestablished — and the reason it is known at all is that the sentinels kept measuring."}]},{"id":"blk-58691","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-113285","text":"4. Two instrument notes carried forward"}]},{"id":"blk-58692","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-58694","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113286","marks":["bold"],"text":"The load-average flag is uninformative during a battery."},{"id":"spn-113287","text":" The battery's own"}]}],"id":"blk-58693","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-58695","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113288","text":"drivers, source and home lift the 1-minute load from ~1.2 to 2.3–2.8, so a \"greater than 2× the block-0 start\" flag fires on most blocks of a healthy run. It is a diagnostic and never gates; a future record may baseline it "},{"id":"spn-113289","marks":["italic"],"text":"after"},{"id":"spn-113290","text":" isolation rather than before."}]},{"id":"blk-58696","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-58698","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113291","marks":["bold"],"text":"Diagnostics are recorded, never promoted."},{"id":"spn-113292","text":" All-core idle, steal, PSI,"}]}],"id":"blk-58697","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":2},{"id":"blk-58699","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-113293","text":"MemAvailable and load are kept in every receipt so a later reader can see the host, and no verdict may rest on them."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieraplwd3aiixlr3ugt73sdt2z7ijqfbpyltzumeja23dprosjiwdvqq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}